    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no one to call, alistair. there is only the dust and the rain. why must you fight for a life that only feels like a sentence? even you, my constant shadow... don't you see how beautiful it would be if we just embraced the end? to stay in this moment, frozen in this perfect, quiet tragedy, instead of struggling against a tide that's already won? why do you insist on tethering me to this agony?",
